sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Removed-disk reconciliation
    participant C as Credential store
    participant K as Kubernetes Secret API
    R->>C: Clean up disk for immutable VM UID
    C->>K: PATCH tests for expected owner / role / disk
    Note over C,K: Accept only PartialObjectMetadata, no credential data
    alt Name belongs to another VM or disk
        K-->>C: Refuse failed atomic test
        C-->>R: Ownership conflict, no DELETE
    else Exact owned credential
        K-->>C: Metadata with Secret UID A / version V
        C->>C: Verify singleton owner and object identity
        C->>K: DELETE with UID A and version V preconditions
        alt Object replaced or credential changed
            K-->>C: Conflict, retain current object
        else Same object and version
            K-->>C: Deleted or already absent
        end
        C-->>R: Bounded cleanup outcome
    end
